    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Based on the armors used by the holy warriors who served under General Arnisant in the Shining Crusade, this well-polished "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+2 greater resilient half plate",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is decorated with religious motifs and carved with sacred scripture. While wearing armor of the holy warrior, your item bonus from the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "greater resilient rune",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " increases from +2 to +3; if you upgrade to a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "major resilient rune",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", the item bonus instead increases from +3 to +4. An undead that critically fails an unarmed attack against you while you wear this armor takes 1d6 vitality damage."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you are evil, you're "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5aa15fa8-99a7-56a4-8237-f605177275dd",
            "label": "Enfeebled 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " while wearing the armor. If you're undead, you also take "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "2d6",
                "damageType": "vitality"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage each round that you wear the armor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
